WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.115
How to watch one.

00:01.886 --> 00:04.539
Go somewhere away from the lights and lie on your back.

00:05.032 --> 00:09.538
After about half an hour in the dark your eyes adapt, and you begin to see meteors.

00:09.980 --> 00:12.425
The hours before dawn are usually the best.

00:13.027 --> 00:14.090
Bring something warm.
